   J. and Power, Mary E. and Tringe, Susannah G. and Li, Wen-Jun and
   Wrighton, Kelly and Harrison, Sue and Morowitz, Michael and Relman,
   David A. and Doudna, Jennifer A. and Lehours, Anne-Catherine and Warren,
   Lesley and Cate, Jamie H. D. and Santini, Joanne M. and Banfield,
   Jillian F.},
Title = {Clades of huge phages from across Earth's ecosystems},
